files.description:
Member files. To get the download URL for the file call GET Files/GetDownloadUrl?fileId={fileId}
- By default this property won't be included in the result. Add `$expand=files` to your query to include it ([more info](http://docs.oasis-open.org/odata/odata/v4.0/os/part2-url-conventions/odata-v4.0-os-part2-url-conventions.html#_Toc372793860)).
- You can filter by this property by adding i.e. `$filter=files/id eq 123` to your query ([more info](http://docs.oasis-open.org/odata/odata/v4.0/os/part2-url-conventions/odata-v4.0-os-part2-url-conventions.html#filter-system-query-optionurl5.1.2)).
